DTSTART;TZID=UTC:20260823T180000
DTEND;TZID=UTC:20260823T200000
SUMMARY:Mindy Seu: A Sexual History of the Internet
DESCRIPTION:Designer and researcher Mindy Seu discusses the evolution of di
 gital subcultures\, examining the relationship between internet history\, 
