 nstitute of Modern Art and is geared toward intellectually engaged audienc
 es interested in internet culture.
LOCATION:James Street\, Fortitude Valley
URL:https://www.ima.org.au/ima-events/mindy-seu-a-sexual-history-of-the-int
 ernet/
END:VEVENT
